  "zh": "# 今日科技产业与社会民生多点发力，国产大飞机取得突破，英特尔市值暴涨引关注。\n## AI 与科技\n- **国产大飞机C929新进展**：国内首款宽体客机取得关键技术突破，预计加速民用航空国产化。\n- **Fujitsu发布MONAKA CPU**：日本厂商推出基于ARM的高性能处理器，旨在挑战Intel与AMD主导地位。\n- **阿里巴巴发布Qwen3.8**：新一代多模态大模型在推理速度与资源消耗上实现显著提升。\n## 产业与市场\n- **英特尔市值一夜暴涨2729亿**：受AI芯片需求激励，股价飙升带来市值巨幅增长。\n- **宁德时代至暗时刻**：电池巨头面临订单下降与成本压力，股价承压引发行业担忧。\n## 社会民生\n- **男子碾轧民警获死刑**：故意撞击执法警员致死，法院核准死刑引发社会对暴力犯罪的关注。\n- **永和豆浆视频被指擦边**：广告片涉嫌低俗引发网络争议，品牌形象受到冲击。",
  "en": "# Today's highlights include breakthroughs in domestic aircraft, Intel's market cap surge, and key social incidents drawing public attention.\n## AI & Tech\n- **Domestic large aircraft C929 progress**: China's first wide-body jet achieves key technological breakthrough, accelerating domestic civil aviation.\n- **Fujitsu launches MONAKA CPU**: Japanese firm unveils ARM-based high-performance processor aiming to challenge Intel and AMD dominance.\n- **Alibaba releases Qwen 3.8**: New multimodal large model delivers significant gains in inference speed and resource efficiency.\n## Industry & Market\n- **Intel market cap jumps 2729 billion**: Driven by AI chip demand, Intel's stock spikes, boosting market value dramatically.\n- **Ningde Era faces dark times**: Battery giant confronts order declines and cost pressures, weighing on shares and sector outlook.\n## Social Livelihood\n- **Man who ran over police sentenced to death**: Deliberate strike on law enforcement officer results in death penalty, sparking public concern over violent crime.\n- **Yonghe soy milk ad accused of being suggestive**: Advertisement deemed vulgar triggers online backlash, impacting brand reputation.}"
